nt-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:50c27c992a565b57ef39bd53879cff0fb6faf353ade41248e7e3a9822a2bbf46","file":"preprints/Stabilizer-Orbits-and-Thick-Tensor-Ideals-of-Dualizable-Kn-Local-Spectra-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":74,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"6560c94c5cf1d7bc82de13f3b98422624e550b5a97dff5bba178fc59c85bffa9","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Stabilizer-Orbits-and-Thick-Tensor-Ideals-of-Dualizable-Kn-Local-Spectra-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:50c27c992a565b57ef39bd53879cff0fb6faf353ade41248e7e3a9822a2bbf46","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Stabilizer-Orbits-and-Thick-Tensor-Ideals-of-Dualizable-Kn-Local-Spectra-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L74"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every prime \\(p\\) and every \\(n\\geq 1\\), the thick tensor ideals of\n\\(\\mathcal D_{(n,p)}\\) are exactly\n\\[\n \\mathcal D_{(n,p)}=\\mathcal D_0\n \\supsetneq\\mathcal D_1\\supsetneq\\cdots\n \\supsetneq\\mathcal D_n\\supsetneq\\mathcal D_{n+1}=0.\n\\]\nIn particular, there are \\(n+2\\) such ideals, and each \\(\\mathcal D_k\\)\nis independent of the chosen finite type-\\(k\\) spectrum."}
